@startuml Seq_Goi_dat_phong_KS
!theme plain

title Hình — Biểu đồ trình tự: Đặt phòng khách sạn\n(HotelBooking + Cart)

actor "Khách hàng" as Guest

participant "HotelCart / Form đặt phòng\n<<boundary>>" as CartUi
participant "HotelBookingPendingView <<boundary>>" as Pend
participant "HotelBookingSuccessView <<boundary>>" as Ok

participant "HotelBookingController <<controller>>" as HB

participant "Cart <<entity>>" as Cart
participant "Hotel <<entity>>" as Hotel
participant "HotelBooking <<entity>>" as Booking

participant "VNPay" as VNP

== Tạo booking từ giỏ ==
Guest -> CartUi : Chọn phòng, ngày, Thanh toán
CartUi -> HB : POST /hotel-booking/create\n(createPost)
HB -> Cart : findOne(userId / sessionId)
Cart --> HB : cart + items[]
HB -> Hotel : findById (kiểm tra KS, phòng)
Hotel --> HB : hotel
HB -> Booking : tạo một hoặc nhiều\nHotelBooking (save)
Booking --> HB : documents
HB -> Cart : deleteOne(cart)
HB --> CartUi : JSON success + bookingCode…

== Thanh toán VNPay ==
Guest -> Pend : Trang chờ + thanh toán
Pend -> HB : pending(req, res)
HB -> Booking : find theo code + phone
Booking --> Pend : render

Guest -> Pend : Thanh toán VNPay
Pend -> HB : GET payment-vnpay
HB --> Pend : HTTP 302 redirect URL VNPay
Guest -> VNP : Thanh toán trên cổng
VNP -> HB : GET payment-vnpay-result
HB -> Booking : verify chữ ký,\ncập nhật paymentStatus
Booking --> HB : OK
HB --> Ok : redirect success

Guest -> Ok : Xem thành công
Ok -> HB : success(req, res)
HB --> Ok : render hotel-booking-success

note over Cart, Booking
  **Cart** (collection **carts**) chỉ phục vụ\nluồng đặt phòng KS; sau createPost\ngiỏ được xóa.
end note

@enduml
